# 14. High-Level Working Flow

At a very high level, the LLM flow is:

```text
User gives input
        ↓
Input is converted into tokens
        ↓
Tokens are processed by the model
        ↓
Model generates output tokens
        ↓
Output tokens become human-readable text
```

Example:

```text
Input: Hi
Output: Hey there, how are you?
```

